{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/18/6949132/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ハカジョのキービジュアル撮影の時の)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋で\nセブンイレブンライブでした(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的に思い入れのある曲を\nたくさん歌えて\n嬉しかったです〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さん\nありがとうございました(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\n私が好きなセブンイレブンの商品は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#まるでマンゴーを冷凍したような\n食感のアイスバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#冷凍味噌ラーメン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#冷凍大学いも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#牛乳寒天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#サラダチキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#カリカリトリプルチーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#ブリトー ハム&チーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はまだまだたくさんあるんですが\n書き切れないのでまた紹介しますね！orz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残る\nセブンイレブンライブは京都！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当選している方は\n楽しみにしていて下さい〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は名古屋にて\n全国握手会♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアは斎藤家のちーちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/18/6949132/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとは\n埼玉出身\n乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部\nじょしらく弐 苦来役"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と何気に共通点がたくさんあるので\nちーちゃんファンの方で\n会話に困ったらこの辺の話題を\n使ってみて下さい♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！待ち時間にLINELIVEを\n見ていただければだいたいの私は\nわかると思います笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://live.line.me/r/channels/231/broadcast/39130"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隙間時間にぜひ〜〜♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18レーン、来てくれる方は\nよろしくお願いします〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだ〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎のぎ天 生配信"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといはのぎ天生配信でした〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華\n井上小百合\n斉藤優里\n新内眞衣\n能條愛未\n樋口日奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と墓場、女子高生のメンバーで\nやらせていただいたよ(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈と絢音ちゃんの\n高校生メンバーが出られなくて残念(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも新内はMCを担当！\nありがとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台メンバーだから\n基本舞台中心に\nいろんなお話をしたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて出てくる話とか\n裏話とか話せて\n凄く楽しかったです◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに愛未ちゃんの\n魔梨威さん聞けたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガスちゃんの天ぷらああ？！\nも聞けてとても良き◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後には視聴者の女の子と\n電話を繋いでリクエストに\n答えたりもしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメレオンを描いて下さい！と\nいうことだったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段ANN0のアフタートークで鍛えている\n画伯 新内を如何なく発揮◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/18/6949132/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素晴らしい作品になりました。\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後日、アーカイブに残るので\n更新されたらまたお知らせしますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ANN0"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は新内先生という謎の企画を\nやりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここには素行の悪い生徒ばかりが\n集まって困ったものです(褒め言葉)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もメールたくさんお待ちしています〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n先週から始まった\n新企画乃木坂モーニングゼミナールは\n伊藤かりんちゃんが担当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんといえば将棋ということで\n将棋のオススメスポットを紹介！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/18/6949132/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃん\nありがとうございました〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは本日も\nスタッフさんブログ\nhttp://www.allnightnippon.com/program/zero/wed/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組メールアドレス\nnogizaka@allnightnippon.com"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LINE LIVEのアフタートーク#25"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://live.line.me/r/channels/231/broadcast/39130"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部♯2６"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎9/2 のぎ天 キャンプ回　後編　#7"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎9/30 BUBKAさん\nラジオに関して取材して頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎毎週水曜　深夜3時〜\n乃木坂46 新内眞衣のANN０\n#AM1242\n#FM93.0\n#LINE LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea